#
# Qcom AWINIC_HAPTIC_HV Driver
#

config AWINIC_86938_HAPTIC_HV
	tristate "AWINIC_86938_HAPTIC_HV driver"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Say Y here if you have Awinic AW869X/AW869XX/AW86938X haptic controller
	  chip in your system.
	  If unsure, say N.
	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called awinic_haptic_hv.

